  "notes": "Seven of 39 YAML candidates now bind fixture-first implementations; 32 remain unimplemented. This is a new bounded projection of the existing Census PackageCandidate at INGEST, not RoadSegment geometry normalization or resolution of the documented broader transport/roads-rail-trade naming conflict. Source ZIPs are capped at 2 MiB, each member at 2 MiB, total expansion 8 MiB, 16 members; the full provider inventory is not covered. Synthetic packages intentionally mismatch unchanged Census reference bytes and all results remain held. Geometry records, SHX offsets, CRS transformations, coverage and operational/legal status are unverified. The accepted ADR-0029 reference supports repository placement and authority boundaries only, not source/rights/sensitivity/data-policy or release approval. Historical receipts are preserved. Prior GBIF and NLCD PRs 5964/5965 were verified merged to main, final main tree matches prior tested source; their hosted reads had no failures but full-local collection canceled. Original dirty checkout is preserved. Git CLI publication auth remains unavailable; use verified-blob connected-app publication and main-targeted PR."
